        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Probability Broach\n- Places: Gallatin Universe, North American continent\n- Organizations: North American Confederacy, Democratic-Republican Party\n- People: Albert Gallatin\n- Concepts: alternate history, libertarian society\n\nFacts:\n- Albert Gallatin was born on January 29, 1761, and died on August 12, 1849.\n- Albert Gallatin was a Swiss-American politician, diplomat, ethnologist, and linguist.\n- Albert Gallatin was an important leader of the Democratic-Republican Party and served in various federal elective and appointed positions across four decades.\n- The Probability Broach is set in an alternate history called the Gallatin Universe.\n- In the Gallatin Universe, a libertarian society has formed on the North American continent.\n- In The Probability Broach, the libertarian society on the North American continent is styled the North American Confederacy (NAC).",
